  .vlp .hero .btn{max-width:360px}
  .vlp .cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}
  .vlp .fix{margin-top:16px;padding:28px 32px;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:32px;align-items:center}
  .vlp .fix .eyebrow{grid-column:1 / -1}
  .vlp .watch{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 340px;column-gap:72px;text-align:left;justify-items:start;align-items:center;padding-top:40px}
  .vlp .watch .head,.vlp .points{justify-items:start}
  .vlp .watch .vid{grid-column:2;grid-row:1 / span 2}
  .vlp .points{font-size:18px}
  .vlp .steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px}
  .vlp .step{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);padding-bottom:0}
  .vlp .step::after{display:none}
  .vlp .familiar{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:56px}
  .vlp .use-grid{gap:56px}
  .vlp .use-grid img{aspect-ratio:1/1}
  .vlp .ritual div{font-size:40px}
  .vlp .rev-photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));overflow:visible;padding:0;margin:0;gap:20px}
  .vlp .swipe{display:none}
  .vlp .quotes{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px;margin-top:32px}
  .vlp .inside,.vlp .faq{padding-inline:max(20px, calc((100% - 760px) / 2))}
  .vlp .offer{padding-inline:max(20px, calc((100% - 640px) / 2));text-align:center}
  .vlp .offer .pack{text-align:left}
  .vlp .bar-in{grid-template-columns:auto 360px;justify-content:space-between}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .vlp *{transition:none!important}
  html{scroll-behavior:auto}
}
</style>

<div class="vlp">
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="strip">Cash on delivery available · Free delivery across India</div>
  <div class="top">
    {%- if settings.logo != blank -%}
      {{ settings.logo | image_url: width: 240 | image_tag: alt: 'Vura', width: 72, height: 57, loading: 'eager' }}
    {%- else -%}
      <span class="sf" style="font:400 32px/1 var(--display)">Vura</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <section class="night hero">
    <p class="pre">Your body works hard for you all day.</p>
    <h1>Don’t punish it for <span class="sf">sweating.</span></h1>
    <div class="shot"><img src="{{ 'vlp-hero-sky.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A hand holding up the VURA fitkari spray against a blue sky, seen from inside a jacket" width="780" height="690" fetchpriority="high"></div>
    <p class="line">Fitkari lets it breathe and just takes care of the smell.</p>
    <div class="proof"><span class="stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span> {{ rating_label }} · {{ rating_count }} customer reviews</div>
    <div class="price-row">
      <span class="v-price">{{ v1_price }}</span>
      <span class="per">50 ml · lasts about 2 months<br><b>That’s about ₹{{ v1_daily }} a day</b></span>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" id="heroBtn" href="#packs">Shop now →</a>
    <div class="assure"><span>Cash on delivery</span><span>Free delivery</span><span>Ships in 1–2 days</span></div>
    <div class="mini-rev">
      <q>It doesn’t try to shut down natural sweat, which is exactly why it feels so natural to wear.</q>
      <span>Nikhita Rao · verified buyer</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="punish">
    <div class="head"><span class="eyebrow">What we usually do to our underarms</span><h2>Sweat isn’t the problem. The usual fixes are.</h2></div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="x"><i aria-hidden="true">✕</i><div><h3>Block it</h3><p>Antiperspirants use aluminium salts to plug your sweat ducts for the day.</p></div></div>
      <div class="x"><i aria-hidden="true">✕</i><div><h3>Drown it</h3><p>Heavy perfume sprayed over the smell, often with alcohol that burns after a shave.</p></div></div>
      <div class="x"><i aria-hidden="true">✕</i><div><h3>Leave a mark</h3><p>White streaks on a black tee. Yellow patches on a white shirt.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fix">
      <span class="eyebrow">VURA does none of that</span>
      <h3>Sweat freely. Smell fresh.</h3>
      <p>A fine mist of fitkari, rose water and aloe. It leaves your sweat alone and works on the smell.</p>
    </div>
